          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"nexus/.*\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"nexus/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9) or vector(0)",
